# 1,10-Phenanthroline + 10 CHCl3: XTB2 MD, spherical confinement
# FIXED: same issue as the DMSO input for this molecule
#   (Phenanthroline_10DMSO_MD.inp) - the Phenanthroline solute was entirely
#   missing ("* xyz 0 1" went straight into the blank line then the
#   Apixaban-scale CHCl3 block), and the Apixaban-scale placement/Cell
#   Sphere parameters (offset 12.78 Ang, radius 14.0 centered at Apixaban's
#   old centroid) were reused unchanged.
#
# This version:
#   - Includes Phenanthroline's own optimized geometry (22 atoms, from
#     Phenanthroline_C2v_r2SCAN3c_Opt.xyz, r2SCAN-3c/C2v).
#   - Phenanthroline centroid = (0, 0, -0.186); max atom-centroid distance =
#     4.59 Ang.
#   - 10 CHCl3 molecules placed at offset 8.0 Ang from that centroid, along
#     the same 12 directions used throughout this project, each rotated so
#     the 3 Cl atoms point radially outward.
#   - Cell Sphere radius set to 11.0 Ang, centered on Phenanthroline's own
#     centroid (0, 0, -0.186).
# Checked: min CHCl3-Phenanthroline atom distance = 2.92 Ang (no clash), max
#   atom distance from the sphere center = 8.75 Ang (safely inside the 11.0
#   Ang sphere). Total atom count = 72 (22 + 10x5), verified.

! XTB2 MD

%md
  Timestep 1.0_fs
  Initvel 298.15_K
  Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
  Cell Sphere 0.0, 0.0, -0.186, 11.0 Spring 20
  Dump Position Stride 100 Filename "Phenanthroline_10CHCl3_XTB.xyz"
  Run 20000
end

